			"Message": "chore(Grove): Update Rust documentation submodule\n\nAdvance the `Documentation/Rust` submodule from commit ca5c2b7 to 7d31fcf. This brings in upstream updates to the shared Rust documentation standards used by the Grove extension host.\n\nNo functional code changes in the main repository; only the submodule pointer is updated.",
			"SHA": "7e4e108b43fd77f138469ef28acb4a25ff998e3b"
