			],
			"Message": "docs(Grove): Rewrite CHANGELOG with Keep a Changelog format and detailed commit history\n\nCompletely revise CHANGELOG.md to adopt Keep a Changelog conventions with expanded sections, commit SHAs, and dates. Key changes:\n\n- Add descriptive header explaining Grove as the Rust/WASM extension-host sidecar\n- Rewrite v2.1 section with full \"Full Workbench Lift\" details covering language-provider registration, provider-forwarding to Mountain, DevLog macro adoption, module PascalCase migration, and re-export cleanup\n- Expand v2.0 to include all February-March 2026 buildout commits from scaffold to working host\n- Consolidate v1.x and v0.0 placeholder commits into summary sections\n- Add LAND_DEV_LOG → Trace rename to the Changed items\n\nThis gives future contributors clear visibility into what was built and why, with specific commit references for deep-diving.",
